designed to expand the VMS customer base and market, they are solely designed
to control/reduce the attrition of existing customers.

If VMS is to survive as a standalone niche operating system, it would be
better off being extremely proprietary with its own APIs totally different
from the rest of the world but that offers capabilities that are unique. (in
other words, emulate the Tandem model).

