said last week, delaying immediate approval. ''There are some pretty hefty bonuses
here.'' Schwinn attorneys said the compensation plan was designed to keep key
personnel from quitting while the bike maker goes through Chapter 11 bankruptcy
reorganization.

The Conference Board, a business organization, has criticized the liberal groups'
executive pay surveys in the past because they include stock options for CEOs, whose
value can fluctuate depending on the market.

