"Bill Todd" <billtodd@foo.mv.com> wrote in message
news:9m7fnu$i6o$1@pyrite.mv.net...
> I suspect that most people haven't really doubted that porting VMS to IA64
> was possible:  I've just never considered it particularly desirable, given
