Stepanov, a Russian, was brought in by chief technology officer Shane
Robison to front the CTO's office.

Sources tell the INQUIRER that this office was largely responsible for
the decision to sink the Alpha iceberg in favour of the Itanic.

Time to re-orient the whole research organisation and to look in a
visionary kind of a way, ahead, then.

