UNIX, OpenVM(tm), Linux, Windows NT and SUN Solaris. ConsoleWorks is a
perfect upgrade from PCM, Robo Central or other older Console Management
Systems. ConsoleWorks has Scanfiles for Tru64 UNIX, OpenVMS 7.3, Compaq
Storage Controllers, SAN Switches and Compaq Alpha(tm) SRM Processors. It is
distributed with the GS AlphaServer and manages ALL Compaq equipment.

