    OpenVMS/Tru64 Strategy (Elias (second session))
    Business issues (Marcello)
    Normal Platform Opening Sessions
    High Powered IPF Q&A (Executive Panel)

...which leads into the last session on Monday - Compaq Listens Panel

...Then we start you off on Tuesday with Storage Strategy (Mark Lewis)
