Technically, 2MB is enough to do 16-bit color at resolutions
up to 1152 X 870; however, this looks like a PowerStorm 3D30 
which I believe will only do 8-bit color.  You could try the 
following, however:

At the end of /usr/lib/X11/Xserver.conf:

! you specify command line arguments here
args <
        -pn -screen 1024x768 -depth 16 -vsync 75
>

You may need to adjust your vsync as appropriate to your
monitor.

