Welcome to the premier edition of Encompass Points! Encompass Points 
is a bi-monthly, e-mail newsletter for Encompass, an independent, 
volunteer-driven organization providing Compaq users with 
opportunities for education, peer networking, and vendor advocacy. If 
you would like to be removed from this list, please send an e-mail to 
