        LDQ t1, i(p)       ADD4 a1=p,i            LD8  t0=[a0],i
        ADDQ t0,t1,ns      LD8  t0=[a0]           LD8  t1=[a0]
                           LD8  t1=[a]            ADD8 ns=t0,t1
