Printing 11 -- DEC ANSI printers
=========================================================================

    Printcap filter specification:     /usr/lbin/pcfof +Cgeneric_ansi.pcf
    Lprsetup printer type:             generic_ansi

    Features:

        Formats text files and eliminates stair stepping.
        Odd and even page printing.

