In article <3b741d9d.615976@news.demon.co.uk>, alldisaj@aja001.demon.co.uk (Tony Alldis) writes:
>
>I manage a Tru64 4.0G system, and have RAID 5 disks in storageworks
>cabinets, using HSG80 controllers.
>
>I have logical volumes that span all 6 drives on a storage shelf,
>bound together.
>
